  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM - WoS PSEA Mechanism - 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since its inception in 2017, the Whole of Syria (WoS) PSEA Program has supported the interagency humanitarian response in joint implementation of international PSEA commitments. Through an established, robust interagency PSEA Network consisting of more than 140 UN agencies, INGOs and NGOs, the program strives to decrease the risk of crisis&#x2010;affected communities experiencing incidents of sexual exploitation and abuse (SEA) by humanitarian workers and provide technical and operational support to humanitarian actors to prevent and respond to SEA cases.</narrative>
  </description>
